---
title: Submit a Project
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block head %}
<style>
  /* ── SUBMISSION CHECKLIST ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .submit-checklist {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    max-width: 720px; margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .submit-item {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
    gap: 24px; align-items: start;
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--soft);
  }
  .submit-item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--soft); }
  .submit-num {
    font-family: 'Big Shoulders Display', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900; font-size: 32px;
    color: var(--red); line-height: 1; padding-top: 4px;
  }
  .submit-item-title {
    font-family: 'Big Shoulders Display', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .submit-item-body { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--gray); }

  /* ── FORM SECTION ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .submit-form-wrap { max-width: 600px; margin: 48px auto 0; text-align: center; }
  .submit-deadline {
    font-family: 'Pixelify Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gray); margin-top: 24px;
  }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .submit-item { grid-template-columns: 36px 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    .submit-num { font-size: 24px; }
  }
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-content">
    <div class="page-hero-eyebrow">Submit a Project</div>
    <h1 class="page-hero-h1">Submit your<br>team's entry.</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-sub">
      Teachers submit one entry per school on behalf of their team. Have your video and team information ready before you open the form. Submissions close November 15.
    </p>
    <div class="page-hero-cta">
      <a href="#submit-form" class="btn-cream">Go to the Form</a>
      <a href="#what-to-prepare" class="btn-ghost-civic">What to Prepare →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="page-hero-visual">
    <img src="/assets/kids-collage.png" alt="Students competing in Battle of the Counties">
  </div>
</div>

<!-- DATE TICKER -->
<div class="ticker">
  <div class="ticker-lbl">Key Dates</div>
  <div class="ticker-items">
    <div class="ticker-event"><span class="ticker-date">SEPT 22</span><span class="ticker-name">World goes live</span></div>
    <div class="ticker-event"><span class="ticker-date">NOV 15</span><span class="ticker-name">Submissions close</span></div>
    <div class="ticker-event"><span class="ticker-date">DEC 4–5</span><span class="ticker-name">County Finals</span></div>
    <div class="ticker-event"><span class="ticker-date">JAN 9, 2027</span><span class="ticker-name">Statewide Championship</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- WHAT TO PREPARE -->
<section id="what-to-prepare" class="sec sec-cream">
  <h2 class="sec-h2 sec-h2-dark page-h2 h2-body">What to have<br>ready.</h2>
  <p class="sec-intro">
    Before you open the form, make sure you have the following on hand.
  </p>
  <div class="submit-checklist">
    <div class="submit-item">
      <div class="submit-num">01</div>
      <div>
        <div class="submit-item-title">School and county information</div>
        <p class="submit-item-body">Your school name, your county (Orange, San Bernardino, Riverside, or Yolo), and a school district email address.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="submit-item">
      <div class="submit-num">02</div>
      <div>
        <div class="submit-item-title">Your team's names and grade level</div>
        <p class="submit-item-body">First and last names of all four students on the team, and their grade level. County champions are recognized by grade level.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="submit-item">
      <div class="submit-num">03</div>
      <div>
        <div class="submit-item-title">A brief project description</div>
        <p class="submit-item-body">A short written summary of the community challenge your team investigated and the solution they built in Minecraft.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="submit-item">
      <div class="submit-num">04</div>
      <div>
        <div class="submit-item-title">A link to your 3-minute video</div>
        <p class="submit-item-body">Your team's video walkthrough, hosted somewhere shareable (YouTube, Google Drive, etc.). The video should be narrated by the students and run no longer than 3 minutes. See below for what judges want to hear.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT THE VIDEO NEEDS TO COVER -->
<section class="sec sec-navy">
  <h2 class="sec-h2 sec-h2-light page-h2 h2-body">What the video<br>needs to cover.</h2>
  <p class="sec-intro sec-intro-light sec-intro-mb">
    Judges review every submission. A strong video covers all four of these in the students' own words.
  </p>
  <div class="grid-4">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-eyebrow card-eyebrow-red">Research</div>
      <h3 class="card-title card-title-light">What did you investigate?</h3>
      <p class="card-body card-body-light">Explain the real community challenge your team chose to address. Show that you listened, researched, and understood the problem before you started building.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-eyebrow card-eyebrow-red">Solution</div>
      <h3 class="card-title card-title-light">What did you design?</h3>
      <p class="card-body card-body-light">Walk through the solution your team built. Explain how it responds to what you learned, not just what it looks like, but why you made the choices you made.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-eyebrow card-eyebrow-red">Build</div>
      <h3 class="card-title card-title-light">Show the build.</h3>
      <p class="card-body card-body-light">Walk judges through your Minecraft build. Every design choice should have a purpose. Show the thinking behind the construction, not just the result.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-eyebrow card-eyebrow-red">Communication</div>
      <h3 class="card-title card-title-light">Make the case.</h3>
      <p class="card-body card-body-light">Explain why your solution would improve your community and who it would benefit. This is where students get to advocate, not just present.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SUBMIT -->
<section id="submit-form" class="sec sec-cream">
  <div class="sec-header">
    <h2 class="sec-h2 sec-h2-dark page-h2">Submit your entry.</h2>
    <p class="sec-header-intro">
      One submission per school. The form collects your school and team information, a brief project description, and a link to your video. Submitting teachers confirm that the entry is the original work of the students listed.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="submit-form-wrap">
    <p class="placeholder-note">Placeholder — Google Form URL needed from Jason before this button goes live.</p>
    <a href="#" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top: 24px; display: inline-block;">Open the Submission Form →</a>
    <p class="submit-deadline">Submissions close November 15, 2026</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA BAND -->
<div class="cta-band">
  <div class="cta-band-inner">
    <h2 class="cta-band-h2">Questions about<br>the competition?</h2>
    <p class="cta-band-body">
      Review the full competition details or reach out directly.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-band-btns">
      <a href="/battle/" class="btn-white">Battle of the Counties</a>
      <a href="mailto:info@levelupcivicsfoundation.org" class="btn-ghost-white">Email us →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% endblock %}
